<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - City of Yonkers, N.Y.</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - City of Yonkers, N.Y.</headline>
<text>
<p>RE: $50,400,000</p>
<p>CITY OF YONKERS, NEW YORK</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price restrictions</p>
<p>are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>First Albany Corporation</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Fleet Securities</p>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
